&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Standards Solutions&lt;/strong&gt; function translates B Lab&#39;s standards into practical pathways for business action and impact. Through certification, B Impact, and a growing portfolio of standards-based products and services, it enables businesses to understand, implement, demonstrate and continuously improve against B Lab&#39;s standards while safeguarding the credibility, integrity and financial sustainability of the certification system.&amp;nbsp;The function provides business leadership for B Corps Certification and B Impact as the primary platform through which businesses engage with B Lab&#39;s standards. Working closely with Product and Technology, it shapes the business requirements that ensure B Impact supports certification, continuous improvement and future standards-based solutions, becoming the digital foundation of B Lab&#39;s impact ecosystem.&amp;nbsp;Working across Standards Development, Product, Customer Experience and Growth, the function creates integrated, customer-centred pathways that are accessible, scalable and efficient. It balances customer experience, commercial sustainability, operational excellence and standards integrity to expand adoption while maintaining the rigour and trust that underpin B Lab&#39;s standards.&amp;nbsp;The function also develops complementary products, services and strategic partnerships that extend the reach of B Lab&#39;s standards and help businesses continuously improve their impact over time. In doing so, it plays a central role in advancing B Lab&#39;s mission by converting ambitious standards into measurable business action, continuous improvement and positive impact at scale.&amp;nbsp;The function succeeds when businesses can confidently adopt and continuously improve against B Lab&#39;s standards through trusted, scalable experiences that deliver stronger customer outcomes,

